From c74d8ea8640e1874651c03ffee72756e5a96ac0d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <winshyon@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 17:55:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Add rule `expect_all_false`

Report `expect_true(all(!x))` and suggest `expect_all_false(x)`
(testthat >= 3.3.0). The fix is marked unsafe because
`expect_all_false()` errors on empty input and compares with
`FALSE` via waldo.

Closes #491
